design_notes = "Matrix contract: Concentration / Status / Kinetics. Inferno is intentionally a mobile aggro-zone spell rather than another stationary Fire Field. The first integrated pass follows Grace for a fixed duration, deals light repeated heat damage, applies Burning, and exposes receive_inferno_heat / receive_heat hooks for objects and environmental systems. A later channel-input pass can sustain this same runtime directly from the Cast button."
